om/bborbe/cqrs` v0.5.2 → v0.6.0\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":7,"oldLines":6,"newStart":7,"newLines":7,"lines":[" "," ## Unreleased"," ","+- docs: add License section to README.md"," - test: add Ginkgo suite bootstrap for root command package"," - refactor: move Kafka SyncProducer construction from factory.CreateSyncProducer to entry point"," "]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false}}
